0%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><strong></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><strong>3. 이수기간 : 15주 이상(법정근로시간)</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><strong></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">4. 이수신청 :\"학기제현장실습신청서\"를 작성하여 해당학부(과)에 제출</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;<u>☞첨부파일참조</u></span></strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #000099; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">5. 신청기간&nbsp;: 2009. 8. 18(화) ~ 8. 21(금)까지(<font color=\"#0000ff\">국내산업체인턴십&nbsp;신청 포함</font>)</font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><font color=\"#ff00ff\">※</font> 국내산업체인턴십(첨부) 신청을 위 학기제현장실습 신청기간과 동일하오니 확인하시기 바랍니다</font>.<br><br><font color=\"#0000ff\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">※ </span>학적부사진 미제출자는 학기제현장실습 신청이&nbsp;불가능 하니, 학생회관 1층 학사서비스센터(478-7066)로 반드시 </font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">사진을 제출하시기 바랍니다.</font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><strong>6. 대상업체(해당학부 종합학사행정실 문의)</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 학교나 학부단위의 산학연계 결연업체 </strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 학부에서 추천하는 전공과 관련이 있는 업체 </strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 기타 학생이 선정한 전공과 관련이 있는 업체</strong> </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #000099; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">7. 수강신청</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #000099; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #000099; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">가. 실습대상자로 허가된 학생은 교무연구과에서 일괄 수강신청.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #000099; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #000099; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">나. 주간수업은 신청할 수 없음.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #000099; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #000099; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">다. 실습기관이 출퇴근 거리를 벗어난 경우 등은 수강신청할 수 없음.<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #000099; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><strong>8. 성적처리 : 현장실습 합격자 S, 불합격자는 U&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\